    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Isaac Asimov was a famous scifi writer of the 20th century. One of his most popular works is the "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Foundation"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " series. The series includes several novels and short stories set in a shared fictional "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "universe",
            "ref": "v-universe"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". These books "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "revolve around",
            "zh": "围绕"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "galactic empire",
            "zh": "银河帝国"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on the verge of collapse. Hari Seldon, a professor, "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "foresees",
            "ref": "v-foresee"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the empire’s failure. He establishes a team of engineers and scientists. They work together to try to save "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "civilisations",
            "ref": "v-civilisation"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Some sci-fi fans believe the "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Foundation"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " series inspired George Lucas to create "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Star Wars"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". But the series has also influenced another world-famous "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "billionaire",
            "ref": "v-billionaire"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ": Elon Musk."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Musk is known for thinking wildly. Many of his ideas, in fact, come from the sci-fi books he has read. When he was a teenager, Musk was a "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "bookworm"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He read the "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Foundation"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " series at a young age. He noticed the similarities between the story and the history of the Roman Empire. Musk says these similarities influenced his worldview. “You should take action to try to save civilisations,” the businessman said. “And if there is really a ‘dark age’, you should try to reduce its length.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Foundation"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " series taught Musk how civilisations move in cycles. He would like to make an “upward cycle” last longer for human beings. Musk believes human beings should act on the possibility of moving life beyond Earth. This belief led him to set up SpaceX. The company has been working to make space travel affordable."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Musk has also read many other sci-fi novels. Douglas Adams’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "The Hitchhiker’s Guide to the Galaxy"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is the one that has inspired him the most. It taught him to always find the big questions first so he could deal with them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Do you and your classmates like reading sci-fi novels? If you do, then perhaps one of you will become the next “Elon Musk”!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
